# Raw automation rule exports. These are NEVER committed: they carry live
# credentials in plaintext (OAuth client secrets in web-request bodies, inbound
# webhook tokens, Slack webhook URLs). Only the redacted per-rule snapshot under
# rules/ goes into the repo -- see scripts/snapshot-rules.mjs.
